    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Eco Challenge Tracker",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nCreate a site map for a web app where users track eco-friendly habits and join challenges.\r\n\r\nYour site map must include:\r\n- A clear home page (the starting point)\r\n- At least 3 main sections that link from the home page (for example: Dashboard, Challenges, Community)\r\n- At least 2 levels of hierarchy  (for example: Home → Challenges → Join Challenge)\r\n\r\n**Save your site map to your Backpack.**",
