    "bubble_choice_description": "Create a site map for a web app where users track eco-friendly habits and join challenges.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/9227eb12e610901c8b0680af1a5c7795-Pasted Graphic 13.png",
    "project_template_level_name": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-level1-level1a-template_2026",
    "name_suffix": "_2026",
    "teacher_markdown": "Since students are filling out a site map, the goal is to ensure their page titles actually reflect the user experience.\r\n\r\nHave students pretend to navigate the site as if they are a user. \r\n\r\nAsk: \"Can a user find a specific challenge, join it, and get back to the Home page in three clicks or less?\" This helps them identify if their sublevel pages are too buried."
  },
